  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget handlar om utredning och utformning av ett nytt bilateralt l&#xe5;ngsiktigt samarbete mellan den albanska och svenska polisen inom omr&#xe5;den av &#xf6;msesidigt intresse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is about fact-finding and design of a new bilateral long-term cooperation between the Albanian and Swedish Police agencies in areas of mutual interest.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To design a new cooperation programme on bilateral basis between the Albanian and
Swedish police agencies, that would respond to police reform needs of the Albanian
partner.</narrative>
